MaleSuicide="%o short circuited some Skrith technology."

[DTA49Shockwave]
DeathStrings=("%k sent a shockwave through %o with %kh A49.","%o was blown away by %k's A49 shockwave.","%o was sent flying by %k's A49.","%k ruptured %o's insides with an A49 shockwave.","%o was pulsed by %k.")
DeathString="%k sent a shockwave through %o with %kh A49."
FemaleSuicide="%o shockwaved her face off."
