[SMATLauncher]
WeaponModes=((ModeName="Single Fire"),(ModeName="Burst"),(ModeName="Auto"))
Description="FGM-16 Shoulder Mounted Anti-Tank Infantry Cannon||Manufacturer: UTC Defense Tech|Primary: Launch Rocket|Secondary: Detonate Rocket||The SMAT Infantry Cannon is a reloadable, single shot rocket launcher. The portable version of the Flak 54 AT system, the FGM-16 SMAT is housed in a reinforced casing with advanced recoil buffering technlogy and fires high-speed HEAT-DP shaped charges for maximum penetration and damage. Engineered after UTC generals noticed the Cryons' knack for overrunning and taking over their Flak 54 sites, this new portable cannon has been the bane of Cryon armored divisions ever since."
ItemName="S.M.A.T. Infantry Cannon"

[SMATPickup]
PickupMessage="You picked up the SM-AT/AA Recoilless Rifle"

[SRXPickup]
PickupMessage="You picked up the SRK-650 enhanced battle rifle."

[SRXRifle]
WeaponModes=((ModeName="Semi-Auto"),(ModeName="Amplified: Explosive"),(ModeName="Amplified: Corrosive"))
ManualLines=("7.62mm Fire","Attach/Detach AMP. Corrosive does extra damage to shield while Explosive damage does radius damage.","Attach/Detach Silencer.")
Description="All weapons evolve over time, adapting to new environments and forms of combat, the SRK-650 Battle Rifle is no exception. NDTR's improvement over the original SRS-900 model, the SRK was created to stand up to the harsh winters of Kalendra with more rugged ergonomics, a holo-sight for closer ranged engagements and a digital ammo counter. But NDTR went one step and beyond by allowing the SRK to not just accept silencers, but also the new elemental AMP tech to counter Cryon armor and Krao hordes with acidic and explosive tech respectively. Slated to join it's longer ranged brother in due time, the SRK will be a blessing for the UTC troops, and a curse for their enemies."
ItemName="SRK-650 Battle Rifle"

[SX45Pickup]
PickupMessage="You picked up the SX45 pistol."

[SX45Pistol]
WeaponModes=((ModeName="Semi-Auto"),(ModeName="Amplified: Cryogenic"),(ModeName="Amplified: Radiation"))
ManualLines=("Semi-automatic .45 ACP Fire. Moderate damage and fire rate.","Attach/Detach AMP. With a Choice of Radiation Bullets and Cryogenic Bullets","Torch Available on the Weapon Function")
Description="As the skrith wars wages onwards, new companies are sprouting left and right to aid in trying times.  The latest to enter into the foray is Storm-X, or SX LTD for short with their offerings of the SX-45K Combat Handgun, chambered in .45ACP and intends to replace the service standard M806.  Precision and power is the motto of this handgun with a Mini-RDS and a threaded barrel to mount various options, including the experimental elemental amp that makes the pistol fire cyro bullets that split or radioactive bullets that leaves clouds behind."
ItemName="SX-45K Combat Handgun"

[SuperchargerWeaponParamsComp]
ArenaParams.WeaponModes=((ModeName="Mode: Area Charge"),(ModeName="Mode: Dolphin"),(ModeName="Mode: Precise Charge"))

